WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.887
A shuffle happens when data must be redistributed
across workers This

00:00:05.914 --> 00:00:12.148
often occurs for GROUP BY ORDER BY DISTINCT and many
joins Shuffles

00:00:12.175 --> 00:00:18.098
are not always bad Sometimes they are necessary But

00:00:18.124 --> 00:00:23.679
they are important because they involve network and
disk work In Spark performance reasoning

00:00:23.916 --> 00:00:25.719
always ask where shuffles occur
